    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00016_YIzumi#2",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Aaand she's back to normal.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00017_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "\"What happened the following day?\" A lot of drugs and a good time, obviously.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00018_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "If that's actually right, this test is getting recalled.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00019_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You two! Quiet! Your ability to concentrate on a given task is also being evaluated.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00020_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "I'd be able to concentrate if SOMEONE hadn't sat by me.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00021_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Ouch, Yukkie. You're making it sound like it's my fault.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00022_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Because it is.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00023_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Whaaa? Yukkie, babe, please don't hate me. I'll do anything, I swear!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00024_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "How many times do I have to tell you? Be quiet!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00025_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Dammit, why am I getting scolded too? This sucks...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00026_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Next: mathematics. The test will cover quadratics and trigonometry. Good luck.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:0",
      "Original": "Quadratics and trig...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:1",
      "Original": "Explain like I'm five|Understood!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00027_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Explain like I'm five.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00028_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You're old enough to understand math.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00029_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "You've gotta be kidding me!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00030_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "What language even IS this?! Aaahhh!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00047_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "At least make an attempt.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00048_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "I'd like to ask the audience.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00049_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "This isn't a gameshow.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00050_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You want me to answer on my own?! What is this, a test?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00051_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "That is correct.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00052_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Seriously, what exactly makes you qualified to be squad leader? Can we get that tested first?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:0",
      "Original": "What makes me qualified?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:1",
      "Original": "Whoopsie gravy!|......",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00053_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Whoopsie gravy!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00064_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Mm...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00065_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Huh? Did I actually hurt your feelings?! I guess that WAS pretty harsh...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:0",
      "Original": "Am I hurt?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:1",
      "Original": "Torpedo whoopsie gravy!|......",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00066_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Torpedo whoopsie gravy!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00067_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "And that is?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00068_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "A \"whoopsie gravy\" that emerges suddenly after an awkward silence.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00069_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Well, it's a great way to piss people off. Never say it again.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00070_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You mean, torpedo whoopsie gravy?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00071_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "I mean ANY whoopsie gravy!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00072_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "I really wish you weren't making me say this multiple times!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00060_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "But it's all the rage in Ruka Land. Who am I supposed to share the joy with, if not you?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00074_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "No one, that's who. Stop trying to make it happen.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00075_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Whaaat.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00076_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Mm...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00077_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Huh... Thought you'd just laugh it off. Sorry, I didn't meant to hurt you.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00078_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Oh, I'm not hurt.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00079_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Then why were you so quiet?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00080_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Don't blame me, blame the dialogue tree.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00081_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Do you see the world as some sort of choose-your-own-adventure game?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00082_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "It's more that I string together the optimal thing to say from a set of options, like a computer algorithm.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00083_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "One hell of a buggy algorithm.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00062_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You two, quiet! This is your last warning!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_02_03_00_Novel_00063_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Dammit!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
